<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Food Lion upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Food Lion upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised its recommendation on Food Lion Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Debra Levin was not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
